{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSymbolStyleLayer(py)symbolZOrder","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"symbolZOrder","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"symbolZOrder","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"symbolZOrder","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Determines whether overlapping symbols in the same layer are rendered in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order that they appear in the data source or by their y-position relative to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the viewport. To control the order and prioritization of symbols otherwise, use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"symbolSortKey"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnsymbolstylelayer\/symbolzorder"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNSymbolStyleLayer\/symbolZOrder","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSExpression","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSExpression"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"symbolZOrder","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value of this property is an expression that evaluates to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"auto"},{